scenario e2_not_reported over e2
  tally 2
  from 2024-11-03
  note "The case 'not reported', which E2-02 asks (asks/E2-02.tally, e2_02_not_reported): Piotr, Anna, Marta and Jakub never reported the inheritance to the Revenue Office. Nothing in the family's papers says whether any heir but Halina reported (story.md 2025-05-05), so it is a hypothetical fact (L §5.5, §6.4), and the scenario states D's rows under D's prefix (L §6.1). It diverges on the day the tax arose (d.igt_arises), the law date of d.igt_tax."

source e2_case_not_reported "The family's question E2-02, its case 'not reported' (tmp/cases-holdout/E2/questions.md; story.md 2025-05-05: nothing in the family's papers says whether any other heir reported)"

